.TH man 1 "2026-06-08" "0.18.2" "Profanity XMPP client"

.SH "نام (NAME)"
/serversoftware

.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Find server or component software version information.

.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
/serversoftware <domain>

.LP

.SH ARGUMENTS
.PP
\fB<domain>\fR
.RS 4
The jid of your server or component.
.RE

.SH "مثال‌ها (EXAMPLES)"
/serversoftware valhalla.edda

.LP
/serversoftware xmpp.vanaheimr.edda

.LP
